WEBVTT

00:09:58.236 --> 00:10:00.596
that we do think should be prioritized.

00:10:01.276 --> 00:10:04.276
Now, time will tell if these work.

00:10:04.316 --> 00:10:07.476
If all of them work, if some,
if any of them work.

00:10:07.476 --> 00:10:08.996
We just don't know.

00:10:09.956 --> 00:10:12.116
But I do want to show you
a couple of examples

00:10:12.156 --> 00:10:14.396
that would suggest
that we're on the right path.

00:10:16.436 --> 00:10:20.356
In the red quadrant, one of the factors
we found relates to inflammation.

00:10:20.956 --> 00:10:23.876
And we often think
of inflammation as being bad,

00:10:23.916 --> 00:10:26.116
but in reality, this is a process

00:10:26.156 --> 00:10:29.756
that our body evolved
to help us recover from injury

00:10:29.796 --> 00:10:32.596
or to mount a fever
to fight off an infection.